      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{l} \\text {齐次线性方程组有非零解，则其系数行列式等于零，即} \\\\ D = \\left| \\begin{matrix} a &amp; 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 2 &amp; a &amp; 2 \\\\ 0 &amp; 1 &amp; a \\end{matrix} \\right| = a (a + 2) (a - 2) = 0 , \\text {所以} a = 0 \\text {或} a = \\pm 2 . \\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{l} \\text {齐次线性方程组有非零解，则其系数行列式等于零，即} \\\\ D = \\left| \\begin{matrix} a &amp; 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 2 &amp; a &amp; 2 \\\\ 0 &amp; 1 &amp; a \\end{matrix} \\right| = a (a + 2) (a - 2) = 0 , \\text {所以} a = 0 \\text {或} a = \\pm 2 . \\end{array}</div>"
