      "answer_index": 2,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{l} \\text {因为当系数行列式} D = \\left| \\begin{matrix} 1 &amp; k &amp; 1 \\\\ k &amp; 1 &amp; - 1 \\\\ 2 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\end{matrix} \\right| = (k + 1) \\left| \\begin{matrix} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ k &amp; 1 &amp; - 1 \\\\ 2 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\end{matrix} \\right| = - k (k + 1) \\neq 0 \\text {时，方程组只有} \\\\ \\text {零解.所以，} \\quad k \\neq 0, - 1. \\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{l} \\text {因为当系数行列式} D = \\left| \\begin{matrix} 1 &amp; k &amp; 1 \\\\ k &amp; 1 &amp; - 1 \\\\ 2 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\end{matrix} \\right| = (k + 1) \\left| \\begin{matrix} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ k &amp; 1 &amp; - 1 \\\\ 2 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\end{matrix} \\right| = - k (k + 1) \\neq 0 \\text {时，方程组只有} \\\\ \\text {零解.所以，} \\quad k \\neq 0, - 1. \\end{array}</div>"
